WEBVTT

01:18.490 --> 01:21.870
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.000 --> 01:24.920
[Episode 34]

01:26.310 --> 01:27.840
So impulsive and reckless.

01:29.039 --> 01:31.840
Now look at this mess—
Shiyu is investigating you,

01:32.009 --> 01:33.870
and Li Qiansheng has also jumped in
to stir things up.

01:33.870 --> 01:34.530
You, oh you.

01:35.229 --> 01:36.470
Before anyone even makes a move,

01:36.470 --> 01:39.509
you've already leapt straight into the pit
you dug for yourself.

01:39.509 --> 01:41.310
And you still want to take over Fulaxida?

01:41.310 --> 01:42.360
Dream on!

01:42.759 --> 01:43.820
So, Chairman Liao,

01:43.840 --> 01:46.570
what should we do now?

01:50.400 --> 01:53.000
I can only rely on you at this point.

02:00.120 --> 02:03.080
And your only option is to save me now,

02:04.140 --> 02:05.020
isn't it?

02:20.400 --> 02:21.280
As for a way out,

02:22.120 --> 02:23.100
there is one.

02:23.400 --> 02:26.030
But you have to follow my arrangements.

02:37.430 --> 02:38.290
Please come in.

02:50.560 --> 02:52.310
Miss Qian, get some good rest.

02:52.310 --> 02:53.840
I won't bother you further.

02:54.310 --> 02:54.910
Thank you.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.329
Once you're done here, come home.

02:56.329 --> 02:57.700
Got it. Just leave.

03:13.520 --> 03:15.720
So how did you know I was in the hospital?

03:19.710 --> 03:21.250
As soon as I got the email,

03:22.030 --> 03:24.430
I realized you'd be targeted
by Sang Shiqi.

03:26.430 --> 03:27.260
I was worried,

03:29.520 --> 03:30.940
so I called Yao Jingjing.

03:31.870 --> 03:35.400
That's how I found out what you've been
up to these past few days.

03:39.590 --> 03:43.190
You actually traveled 5,000 kilometers
back and forth in 2 days.

03:45.310 --> 03:47.190
Your driving skills are lousy,

03:48.400 --> 03:50.930
yet you went ahead
and rented some beat-up car

03:51.030 --> 03:53.560
to drive all the way to
Peach Blossom Village?

03:55.910 --> 03:57.240
Have you lost your mind?

04:06.120 --> 04:07.850
Why would you do all this for me?

04:11.390 --> 04:11.920
Why?

04:18.390 --> 04:19.160
No reason.

04:19.800 --> 04:22.000
By the way, has your matter been solved?

04:23.680 --> 04:24.680
It has.

04:24.720 --> 04:26.450
With how much you've helped me,

04:26.480 --> 04:27.810
how could it not be?

04:38.190 --> 04:39.890
But seeing you get hurt

04:41.750 --> 04:42.680
breaks my heart.

04:44.870 --> 04:45.670
It's nothing.

04:45.920 --> 04:48.110
Look, I'm perfectly fine—

04:48.159 --> 04:49.220
not even a scratch.

04:54.659 --> 04:55.790
Are you really okay?

04:59.270 --> 05:00.670
Then what's your choice?

05:30.310 --> 05:31.920
Actually, deep down, your choice

05:31.920 --> 05:32.980
has always been me,

05:35.430 --> 05:36.150
right?

05:39.680 --> 05:41.870
You just didn't want to give me
another chance to hurt you,

05:41.870 --> 05:43.630
ignore you, or mistreat you.

05:46.600 --> 05:47.570
That's why you made up

05:47.570 --> 05:48.990
that lie the other day

05:52.120 --> 05:53.720
and even asked me to move out.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.460
If you really had no feelings for me
anymore,

06:00.560 --> 06:01.660
how could you possibly

06:01.660 --> 06:03.790
have traveled 5,000 kilometers for me

06:05.510 --> 06:08.110
just because of some data backup
on a computer?

06:17.190 --> 06:19.250
Do you have any idea how worried I was?

06:20.840 --> 06:22.970
I was terrified at the hospital today.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.760
If the person being resuscitated
had been you,

06:24.760 --> 06:25.800
I couldn't even imagine it.

06:25.800 --> 06:27.120
If I never got to see you again,

06:27.120 --> 06:27.960
I'd go crazy.

06:32.430 --> 06:33.409
Qian Fei.

06:36.040 --> 06:38.000
Can I keep liking you?

06:41.870 --> 06:43.130
Let me take care of you.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.610
Starting from now,

06:49.360 --> 06:51.020
let me start to truly love you,

06:52.390 --> 06:53.080
okay?

07:07.680 --> 07:09.490
Why aren't you saying anything?

07:09.600 --> 07:12.060
If you don't say anything,
I'll take it as...

09:39.670 --> 09:40.300
Yifei?

09:41.120 --> 09:42.320
When did you get here?

09:42.440 --> 09:43.500
I just arrived.

09:47.080 --> 09:48.120
Did I wake you up?

09:48.150 --> 09:49.120
No, no, not at all.

09:49.120 --> 09:50.050
Just took a nap.

09:53.360 --> 09:54.890
Quite a nice one, actually.

09:58.390 --> 09:59.190
Want some tea?

10:00.910 --> 10:01.570
Dad.

10:04.870 --> 10:05.660
I'm here

10:06.910 --> 10:07.640
to thank you.

10:11.720 --> 10:13.380
Thank you for saving Qian Fei.

10:19.630 --> 10:20.560
You're welcome.

10:26.670 --> 10:28.950
How did you know Qian Fei was in danger?

10:31.150 --> 10:32.150
What do you think?

10:35.550 --> 10:38.230
I've been around longer
than you've been alive.

10:39.320 --> 10:39.790
Let me tell you—

10:39.790 --> 10:42.150
you know far too little about

10:42.320 --> 10:44.520
the dirty tricks in the business world.

10:49.510 --> 10:51.190
So, Dad, you've had

10:52.030 --> 10:54.160
people protecting Qian Fei all along?

11:00.230 --> 11:01.800
I just didn't want to repeat

11:02.870 --> 11:04.910
the mistake I made with your mother—

11:07.440 --> 11:08.870
to stand by

11:10.270 --> 11:13.070
and watch you lose another person
you love deeply.

11:26.360 --> 11:26.960
Dad.

11:42.190 --> 11:42.960
Yifei.

11:45.270 --> 11:46.280
I don't think

11:46.840 --> 11:47.900
this... this whole

11:48.320 --> 11:50.560
"loving father, dutiful son" act

11:50.580 --> 11:52.260
really suits us two.

11:54.640 --> 11:56.530
That's true. Indeed.

11:56.550 --> 11:57.950
It's not really fitting.

11:58.750 --> 12:02.000
Even though I've been looking forward
to this day for most of my life,

12:02.000 --> 12:05.510
-I'm still c-can't quite get used to it.
-True. True.

12:12.030 --> 12:13.240
Alright.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.980
L-Let me tell you the truth.

12:17.240 --> 12:19.030
Actually, I had my own little motive

12:19.030 --> 12:20.580
for saving Qian Fei.

12:22.620 --> 12:25.070
I just wanted you to owe me a favor.

12:27.790 --> 12:29.850
Just come back to Qiansheng already.

12:31.380 --> 12:32.500
W-What are you laughing at?

12:32.500 --> 12:33.580
I'm serious.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.860
You have no idea what kind of shape

12:34.860 --> 12:37.500
Q-Qiansheng Group is in right now.

12:38.790 --> 12:42.550
Those foreigners have almost bled us dry.

12:44.320 --> 12:45.520
Come back right away.

12:46.320 --> 12:48.730
Dad, have you ever considered

12:50.320 --> 12:52.720
there are other ways to save the group?

12:52.790 --> 12:54.390
I've thought about all that,

12:55.150 --> 12:56.150
but

12:57.790 --> 13:00.720
the process is too complicated
and time-consuming,

13:01.030 --> 13:04.230
and the financial risks are too high.

13:04.250 --> 13:07.050
That's why we need to resort to
a backdoor listing.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.300
You mean...

13:16.960 --> 13:20.410
Use my Fulaxida to help Qiansheng

13:21.030 --> 13:22.360
get a backdoor listing.

13:40.600 --> 13:41.730
I understand now.

13:43.150 --> 13:46.750
So that's why you've been reluctant
to come back all these years,

13:47.150 --> 13:48.430
even selling your property to invest—

13:48.430 --> 13:49.190
you were

13:49.840 --> 13:51.650
paving a way out for Qiansheng,

13:52.120 --> 13:52.850
weren't you?

13:54.360 --> 13:56.620
Dad, actually, from the very beginning,

13:57.150 --> 13:59.600
I've never looked down on Qiansheng.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.010
On the contrary,

14:06.480 --> 14:07.540
I love it very much.

14:15.120 --> 14:16.140
You little brat.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.100
You've grown up.

14:31.440 --> 14:32.240
Have some tea,

14:32.240 --> 14:34.100
and I'll explain it to you slowly.

14:43.000 --> 14:44.310
Little brat.

15:10.120 --> 15:15.950
[Zhizhong Construction Investment
Securities Co., Ltd]

15:51.840 --> 15:53.740
Liu, help me check the report.

15:53.870 --> 16:01.450
[Marketing Director's Office]

16:01.560 --> 16:06.710
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

16:11.390 --> 16:12.180
Hello,

16:12.750 --> 16:14.210
is this Mr. Sang's office?

16:23.530 --> 16:25.460
[Marketing Director's Office]

16:27.360 --> 16:28.890
You must be Fang Yun, right?

16:29.600 --> 16:30.260
Yes, I am.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.360
You are suspected of
stealing trade secrets.

16:33.360 --> 16:35.760
Please cooperate with our investigation.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.120
I think

16:38.840 --> 16:40.630
this might be
some kind of misunderstanding.

16:40.630 --> 16:44.760
We won't know if it's a misunderstanding
until the investigation is over.

16:46.870 --> 16:48.440
Let me just grab my things.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.110
Alright.

16:49.450 --> 16:49.970
Okay.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.300
Excuse me.

16:55.440 --> 16:56.510
Excuse me.

17:05.510 --> 17:07.480
All the documents you wanted
are here.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.940
From now on,

17:09.550 --> 17:11.480
she's no longer a He Jing employee.

17:12.160 --> 17:14.290
Hand the documents over to the police.

17:20.869 --> 17:24.760
[Marketing Director's Office]

17:21.109 --> 17:22.030
Let's go.

17:40.590 --> 17:41.200
Let's go.

18:33.690 --> 18:36.290
[Dongyuan Police Station, Donghai Branch,
Shanghai Municipal Public Security Bureau]

18:34.960 --> 18:36.430
I was set up and used

18:36.750 --> 18:38.410
by that guy surnamed Sang.

18:40.240 --> 18:42.540
I lost all my money

18:43.960 --> 18:45.400
and ended up in deep debt.

18:47.270 --> 18:48.010
With

18:48.200 --> 18:50.200
elderly parents to support at home,

18:52.720 --> 18:54.210
I was truly at my wits' end,

18:55.790 --> 18:58.590
which was why I ended up
being used by that Sang guy.

19:00.390 --> 19:02.640
[Rongcheng Rd]

19:02.750 --> 19:03.230
[Police]

19:08.290 --> 19:09.750
I know

19:10.440 --> 19:13.530
this world isn't simply black and white.

19:14.270 --> 19:15.590
But I also believe

19:15.750 --> 19:17.240
that deep down,

19:17.790 --> 19:20.510
everyone can distinguish
between right and wrong.

19:20.510 --> 19:21.650
All this time,

19:21.880 --> 19:24.240
I've treated you as my idol

19:24.510 --> 19:26.710
and aspired to become someone like you.

19:27.070 --> 19:28.960
But now, the flag that once guided me—

19:28.960 --> 19:30.120
the lighthouse
that once illuminated my path—

19:30.120 --> 19:31.340
no longer exists.

19:32.240 --> 19:33.670
But I'm not afraid.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.800
Because I know
I'm heading in the right direction.

19:51.960 --> 19:52.600
If you need

19:52.680 --> 19:54.330
any help with the investigation later on,

19:54.330 --> 19:55.830
feel free to contact me at any time.

19:55.830 --> 19:57.590
Okay. Thank you for your hard work.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.870
It's our job.

20:00.050 --> 20:02.450
It's still at home.
I haven't dared to touch

20:02.510 --> 20:03.570
a single cent of it.

20:05.510 --> 20:07.310
Looking back on where I am today,

20:08.920 --> 20:10.680
I really regret it.

20:14.920 --> 20:16.750
Alright, you guys may head back first.

20:16.750 --> 20:17.030
Okay.

20:17.030 --> 20:17.630
Thank you.

20:20.990 --> 20:24.610
[Be Loyal to the Party, Serve the People,
Be Impartial in Law Enforcement, Strict in Discipline]

20:26.070 --> 20:28.110
You're still unwilling
to accept this fact,

20:28.110 --> 20:28.790
right?

20:33.480 --> 20:34.070
Let's go.

20:40.070 --> 20:40.930
Director Fang?

20:52.400 --> 20:55.360
Can I have a quick word with them?

20:56.920 --> 20:58.440
Okay, be quick.

20:58.960 --> 20:59.960
I'll wait for you outside.

20:59.960 --> 21:00.720
Okay.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.960
Yang, deliver the documents first.

21:14.110 --> 21:15.180
I've always felt

21:15.310 --> 21:17.170
that the two of us are quite alike.

21:22.880 --> 21:24.130
When I was little,

21:24.550 --> 21:26.280
my grandmother used to tell me,

21:26.400 --> 21:28.270
"A slow and steady pace
keeps the cart from tipping over."

21:28.270 --> 21:30.350
But back then, I found her quite annoying—

21:30.350 --> 21:31.070
she'd go on and on,

21:31.070 --> 21:32.920
and I didn't understand
what she was saying.

21:32.920 --> 21:35.120
Now that I do, it seems a little too late.

21:38.660 --> 21:42.720
Sometimes, doing the right thing really
does come with a lot of hardship.

21:43.930 --> 21:44.900
But maybe

21:46.070 --> 21:46.920
that's also

21:49.960 --> 21:52.690
a kind of test on the way to
the happiness you want.

22:00.470 --> 22:01.530
I used to

22:03.180 --> 22:05.440
try to shape you into

22:06.680 --> 22:07.780
what I wanted,

22:07.880 --> 22:08.980
because I thought

22:09.820 --> 22:10.920
you and I were alike.

22:10.920 --> 22:12.190
But now I realize

22:12.220 --> 22:13.980
that you are different from me.

22:17.310 --> 22:18.920
Stay true to yourself.

22:19.620 --> 22:20.950
I really like you.

23:42.250 --> 23:45.200
[Strengthening Awareness of Confidentiality,
Building a Solid Security Defense]

23:48.510 --> 23:51.730
[Strengthening Awareness of Confidentiality,
Building a Solid Security Defense]

24:48.150 --> 24:51.420
[As you instructed, I didn't take]

24:55.170 --> 24:56.130
[As you instructed,
I didn't take the flight]

24:56.150 --> 24:57.080
[I had booked, and I can rebook
a different one right away.]

25:08.480 --> 25:09.410
[As you instructed,
I didn't take the flight]

25:09.440 --> 25:10.740
[I had booked, and I can rebook
a different one right away.]

25:14.290 --> 25:15.430
Idiot.

25:17.880 --> 25:19.830
Sang Shiqi, you idiot!

25:34.110 --> 25:35.820
[Unknown Number from Shanghai]

25:44.350 --> 25:45.570
Hello? Who is it?

25:49.160 --> 25:49.960
The police?

25:59.440 --> 26:00.180
Sang Shiqi.

26:00.200 --> 26:02.130
Where are you going in such a hurry?

26:03.480 --> 26:04.080
Freeze!

26:04.830 --> 26:05.630
Take him away.

26:08.000 --> 26:11.000
So what if you found out
that I had had contact with him?

26:11.240 --> 26:13.940
I have nothing to do with this matter.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.520
Listen to me...

26:18.480 --> 26:20.480
Cooperate with the investigation?

26:20.830 --> 26:23.010
Okay. Okay.

26:32.160 --> 26:35.220
I, Liao Jinshan, am not someone
you can scheme against.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.620
Shiyu, you're still up?

26:54.790 --> 26:56.760
It's quite late. Go to sleep.

26:57.550 --> 27:00.070
I've had a long day and am a bit tired.

27:01.030 --> 27:01.630
Dad.

27:02.270 --> 27:04.600
Are you busy cutting ties with Sang Shiqi?

27:12.590 --> 27:13.880
I've figured it all out.

27:13.880 --> 27:16.160
The one who ordered 0.33
to attack Shanlifang

27:16.160 --> 27:17.090
was Sang Shiqi,

27:17.200 --> 27:18.920
and you already knew about this

27:18.920 --> 27:20.420
before I did.

27:21.720 --> 27:23.980
But why didn't you hold him accountable?

27:24.640 --> 27:26.500
Why did you choose to forgive him?

27:26.960 --> 27:27.640
Why?

27:30.030 --> 27:31.030
Of course I did it

27:31.590 --> 27:33.180
for Shanlifang.

27:34.550 --> 27:36.210
Don't you find it ridiculous?

27:40.750 --> 27:41.880
What's ridiculous?

27:43.590 --> 27:45.650
If I had held Sang Shiqi accountable,

27:46.070 --> 27:48.350
would Shanlifang's problems
have been solved immediately?

27:48.350 --> 27:49.320
Or

27:49.830 --> 27:51.290
should I just watch you

27:51.310 --> 27:53.400
lead Shanlifang through
endless rectifications,

27:53.400 --> 27:55.800
waiting for an IPO
that's nowhere in sight?

27:56.750 --> 27:59.580
Even so, you shouldn't be an accomplice
to wrongdoing.

27:59.580 --> 28:00.540
Liao Shiyu!

28:07.240 --> 28:08.570
Listen to me carefully.

28:10.000 --> 28:12.310
I have nothing to do with

28:12.340 --> 28:14.000
Sang Shiqi's shady dealings.

28:17.240 --> 28:19.970
The problems at Shanlifang
have always existed.

28:22.300 --> 28:24.480
The losses caused by Sang Shiqi's exposure
are,

28:24.480 --> 28:25.700
in a sense,

28:26.440 --> 28:28.380
far less than the losses we would suffer
if we were to

28:28.380 --> 28:30.780
reveal them ourselves after going public!

28:32.110 --> 28:34.110
It is true that Sang Shiqi
is a petty person,

28:34.110 --> 28:36.630
but his desire for Shanlifang
to invest in Fulaxida

28:36.630 --> 28:38.470
wasn't purely self-serving.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.610
You've seen

28:43.880 --> 28:45.200
Fulaxida's momentum yourself.

28:45.200 --> 28:47.000
If we can achieve a backdoor listing,

28:47.000 --> 28:48.410
wouldn't that be much faster

28:48.410 --> 28:50.010
than going public on our own?

28:51.830 --> 28:53.930
Dad, I didn't expect you to be so...

28:54.070 --> 28:54.950
So what?

28:55.070 --> 28:57.130
So shameless that you know no limits!

28:57.960 --> 28:58.790
Limits?

28:59.720 --> 29:00.900
What are limits?

29:02.510 --> 29:04.030
In business, the only limit

29:04.030 --> 29:05.570
is to maximize profits!

29:08.350 --> 29:10.350
Liao Shiyu, listen to me carefully.

29:10.480 --> 29:11.610
From today onwards,

29:12.090 --> 29:14.680
you'll be the general manager
of the lowest-level business division.

29:14.680 --> 29:16.720
The position of
Shanlifang's vice president

29:16.720 --> 29:18.320
will be temporarily vacant.

29:19.250 --> 29:19.960
Where are you going?

29:19.960 --> 29:20.880
To file my resignation!

29:20.880 --> 29:21.430
You...

29:21.720 --> 29:22.920
Vice President Liao.

29:23.640 --> 29:26.900
Chairman, do you want me
to go and talk to her?

29:28.790 --> 29:30.050
Don't worry about her.

29:31.720 --> 29:33.320
Go to the finance department

29:33.400 --> 29:35.260
and do what you're supposed to do.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.400
What should we eat later?

29:51.440 --> 29:52.550
I'm going home to get some sleep.

29:52.550 --> 29:54.070
Why are you always so tired?

29:54.070 --> 29:56.070
How about we go for a couple of drinks?

29:56.070 --> 29:56.830
A couple of drinks?

29:56.830 --> 29:57.590
Sure.

31:02.090 --> 31:03.800
[Zhonggeng Global Creative Center]

31:11.960 --> 31:12.520
Qian Fei!

31:17.480 --> 31:18.110
Mr. Zhang.

31:19.200 --> 31:19.480
Morning.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.540
Morning, morning.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.680
After you, Mr. Zhang.

31:45.350 --> 31:47.460
You're really something.

31:47.510 --> 31:49.610
Li Yifei has such clout,

31:49.660 --> 31:55.260
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

31:49.920 --> 31:51.650
and it's not like you don't like him.

31:51.650 --> 31:53.030
Yet here you are,
pretending not to notice him.

31:53.030 --> 31:55.200
I just want to test his patience.

31:57.030 --> 31:59.100
Take it easy, girl.

31:59.240 --> 32:01.650
Or you might end up pushing him away,

32:01.680 --> 32:02.690
and then you'll come crying to me

32:01.740 --> 32:09.470
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

32:02.720 --> 32:04.240
about how lonely you are.

32:04.960 --> 32:06.940
If he can be pushed away that easily,

32:06.940 --> 32:10.200
then that just means he was never
really mine to begin with.

32:11.400 --> 32:13.160
Alright. Good for you.

32:17.720 --> 32:24.400
[President's Office]

32:18.310 --> 32:19.280
Mr. Zhang.

32:20.350 --> 32:22.240
Qian Fei. Have a seat.

32:22.910 --> 32:24.560
You took just 2 days of leave—

32:24.580 --> 32:25.720
how did you manage to dig up

32:25.720 --> 32:27.070
such an eye-catching project?

32:27.070 --> 32:28.810
It was just a coincidence

32:28.830 --> 32:30.440
that I crossed paths with Fulaxida.

32:30.440 --> 32:32.340
I don't think it was just a coincidence.

32:32.340 --> 32:36.070
[President's Office]

32:32.590 --> 32:33.820
Look at this project.

32:34.510 --> 32:36.030
Mr. Zhang, Mr. Li is here.

32:36.400 --> 32:37.040
Mr. Li.

32:38.720 --> 32:39.500
Please.

32:39.680 --> 32:40.210
Have a seat.

32:39.890 --> 32:41.260
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

32:42.000 --> 32:42.550
Please.

32:45.750 --> 32:46.410
Have a seat.

32:48.140 --> 32:49.770
I guess I don't need to
introduce you two, right?

32:49.770 --> 32:50.370
No need.

32:50.400 --> 32:52.160
We're old colleagues.
We know each other really well.

32:52.160 --> 32:54.400
Qian Fei, this is your fault.

32:54.480 --> 32:55.590
With such a great project,

32:55.590 --> 32:57.070
we should have gotten involved earlier.

32:57.070 --> 32:58.670
That's not exactly the case.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.500
It's mainly that our Fulaxida

33:00.590 --> 33:03.470
has always had relatively high
requirements for investors,

33:03.470 --> 33:05.130
and we kept turning them away.

33:05.440 --> 33:07.350
Because what we lack isn't money,

33:07.550 --> 33:10.730
but visionary investors.

33:11.880 --> 33:13.510
You're also an expert in this area.

33:13.510 --> 33:14.560
The fact that your company
responded so quickly

33:14.560 --> 33:16.350
to our Xinzouqi's investment proposal—

33:16.350 --> 33:16.920
doesn't that mean

33:16.920 --> 33:18.970
that we share the same vision?

33:19.030 --> 33:19.810
Of course.

33:20.070 --> 33:21.040
Most importantly,

33:21.040 --> 33:22.840
I saw your sincerity and respect

33:23.070 --> 33:25.570
in this investment proposal—

33:26.310 --> 33:27.430
not just toward us,

33:27.920 --> 33:29.680
but also toward the farmers

33:29.750 --> 33:31.870
in western rural areas
who are part of this project.

33:31.870 --> 33:36.900
[President's Office]

33:32.270 --> 33:34.550
And I think the most important thing
is that

33:34.550 --> 33:36.470
even more farmers
will be joining this initiative

33:36.470 --> 33:37.330
going forward.

33:38.750 --> 33:41.190
Yes. Generally speaking, most investors
focus on money

33:41.190 --> 33:42.650
and return on investment.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.380
But I think our Xinzouqi is different.

33:44.380 --> 33:46.490
What Xinzhouqi cares about is
whether every penny invested

33:46.490 --> 33:48.440
can go into the very center
of meaningful resources,

33:48.440 --> 33:49.940
and whether it can create

33:50.000 --> 33:51.700
a positive butterfly effect
to the society.

33:51.700 --> 33:52.670
I think the reason
the "Everything Grows" app

33:52.670 --> 33:53.520
is so impressive

33:53.520 --> 33:54.880
isn't just because

33:55.080 --> 33:57.750
it starts small
and builds to something big.

33:57.940 --> 33:58.560
More importantly,

33:58.560 --> 34:00.790
we see the value in its ability
to connect—

34:00.790 --> 34:02.630
to bridge the two most distant points

34:02.630 --> 34:03.520
in the world.

34:04.560 --> 34:06.350
So I'm very confident in this project,

34:06.350 --> 34:08.880
and I've outlined all of this
in the proposal.

34:10.600 --> 34:11.750
I agree with you.

34:11.860 --> 34:13.770
Now I officially appoint you

34:13.800 --> 34:15.429
as the lead on this project.

34:15.449 --> 34:16.880
What do you two think?

34:17.350 --> 34:19.350
Sounds great. I couldn't ask for more.

34:19.350 --> 34:20.610
Can I really handle it?

34:22.780 --> 34:24.310
Pleasure working with you.

34:29.520 --> 34:30.420
Thank you.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.900
Drink up, you clingy pest.

34:54.190 --> 34:56.150
You were the one who ignored me first.

34:56.150 --> 34:57.230
You left me with no choice but to accept

34:57.230 --> 34:58.890
an investment from Xinzouqi.

34:59.120 --> 35:00.770
Otherwise, I wouldn't even
get a chance to talk to you.

35:00.770 --> 35:02.790
Stop flattering yourself.

35:02.960 --> 35:05.220
Do you think I don't know why you're here?

35:05.750 --> 35:06.920
You're the type

35:07.350 --> 35:09.480
who keeps feelings and work
strictly separate

35:09.480 --> 35:11.080
and knows exactly where you stand.

35:11.080 --> 35:12.310
Aren't you the same?

35:13.560 --> 35:15.150
It's not like you don't know me, Lu Ze,

35:15.150 --> 35:16.100
or Ma Li.

35:16.150 --> 35:18.310
When you went to Peach Blossom Village
and saw "Everything Grows",

35:18.310 --> 35:20.720
why didn't you come to me
for first-hand data?

35:20.720 --> 35:23.650
Instead, you worked on the proposal
all by yourself.

35:23.750 --> 35:26.520
Independent research is the best way
to avoid pitfalls.

35:26.520 --> 35:27.060
Got it?

35:27.190 --> 35:28.630
That just proves my point.

35:28.630 --> 35:30.430
It's because you like me too much

35:31.400 --> 35:34.860
and you were worried
it would affect your objective judgment.

35:39.750 --> 35:40.440
Qian Fei.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.420
I've got patience.

35:44.750 --> 35:45.870
Whether it's work

35:46.670 --> 35:47.600
or pursuing you,

35:48.630 --> 35:49.560
I have patience.

35:54.270 --> 35:55.480
You know,

35:55.750 --> 35:56.830
we're definitely going to be

35:56.830 --> 35:57.960
seeing each other a lot at work

35:57.960 --> 35:59.380
from now on.

36:00.400 --> 36:01.400
So next,

36:01.420 --> 36:03.420
we'll need to set some ground rules.

36:09.350 --> 36:09.880
Go ahead.

36:10.270 --> 36:10.920
First,

36:12.600 --> 36:13.520
we can't let anyone know

36:13.520 --> 36:14.960
how close we are.

36:16.230 --> 36:17.310
We have to make it seem like

36:17.310 --> 36:19.080
we're just colleagues.

36:21.150 --> 36:21.890
Second,

36:22.560 --> 36:24.190
things like delivering flowers

36:24.190 --> 36:24.920
at the door last time

36:24.920 --> 36:26.250
is never allowed again.

36:29.720 --> 36:30.320
Third,

36:31.440 --> 36:32.120
if

36:33.310 --> 36:37.080
you're going to a bar
or any other seedy place,

36:37.560 --> 36:38.620
you have to tell me.

36:38.750 --> 36:40.750
If you absolutely have to

36:40.750 --> 36:42.080
flirt with other girls,

36:42.230 --> 36:44.480
you have to be airtight about it.

36:45.350 --> 36:47.610
If I ever find out,
I'll beat you to death.

36:53.000 --> 36:53.440
Speak.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.480
Why can't we let others know

36:55.480 --> 36:56.750
about our relationship?

36:56.750 --> 36:58.280
Why can't I come pick you up?

36:58.350 --> 36:59.350
I've lived my whole life

36:59.350 --> 37:01.350
openly and with dignity.

37:01.350 --> 37:03.150
Since when am I not presentable?

37:03.790 --> 37:04.440
And also,

37:05.120 --> 37:08.310
why are bars automatically
treated as seedy places?

37:08.560 --> 37:11.090
They've got proper
business licenses, okay?

37:11.830 --> 37:13.090
And most importantly,

37:13.560 --> 37:14.270
those girls think

37:14.270 --> 37:15.600
I'm cool, handsome, and cute,

37:15.600 --> 37:16.600
and they just want to look at me
a little longer.

37:16.600 --> 37:18.440
What can I do about that, right?

37:18.520 --> 37:21.520
You can't just erase natural good looks,
can you?

37:23.000 --> 37:23.800
You know what?

37:24.190 --> 37:25.520
It was from the way you and Gui Lili

37:25.520 --> 37:26.880
interacted with each other

37:26.880 --> 37:28.280
that I discovered
these bad habits of yours.

37:28.280 --> 37:30.230
If it were someone else's boyfriend,

37:30.230 --> 37:31.520
I could just laugh it off.

37:31.520 --> 37:32.480
But for my boyfriend,

37:32.480 --> 37:33.610
I can't tolerate it.

37:36.350 --> 37:37.630
Then you can't call this

37:37.630 --> 37:39.280
setting ground rules for work.

37:39.280 --> 37:42.440
What you're doing is declaring sovereignty
over your boyfriend.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.080
Quiet.

37:47.110 --> 37:48.230
I am declaring sovereignty.

37:48.230 --> 37:49.760
So what? Is there a problem?

37:52.750 --> 37:53.210
Lifted.

37:53.310 --> 37:54.480
Of course not.

37:56.940 --> 37:59.640
So if I agree to this,

37:59.710 --> 38:01.560
shouldn't you help me more

38:01.560 --> 38:02.670
at work as well?

38:04.880 --> 38:06.630
This work is what I'm supposed to do
anyway.

38:06.630 --> 38:08.190
What does it have to do with helping you?

38:08.190 --> 38:09.190
Of course it does.

38:10.120 --> 38:12.710
Fulaxida's business
is constantly expanding.

38:12.710 --> 38:14.440
Although the threat from Sang Shiqi

38:14.440 --> 38:15.080
has been dealt with,

38:15.080 --> 38:17.340
Liao Jinshan is still actively probing.

38:18.080 --> 38:19.080
I can't possibly keep an eye on

38:19.080 --> 38:20.940
every single investor by myself,

38:20.960 --> 38:21.830
right?

38:21.920 --> 38:24.120
If problematic capital like Shanlifang

38:24.120 --> 38:25.350
suddenly takes advantage of the situation,

38:25.350 --> 38:28.680
that would deal a heavy blow to
everything we've worked for.

38:29.230 --> 38:31.190
If Shanlifang intends to

38:31.190 --> 38:31.940
invest in Fulaxida,

38:31.940 --> 38:33.710
it must first resolve its own issues

38:33.710 --> 38:35.710
that can't be solved overnight.

38:36.120 --> 38:37.080
But even if they do,

38:37.080 --> 38:38.540
new issues will arise.

38:38.750 --> 38:40.740
So what can I do about them?

38:42.310 --> 38:44.840
Let's put Shanlifang's issues aside
for now.

38:45.350 --> 38:46.400
What we need to focus on now

38:46.400 --> 38:47.530
is another company—

38:48.790 --> 38:50.060
Qiansheng Group.

38:50.880 --> 38:51.540
Qiansheng?

38:51.820 --> 38:52.230
Yes.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.560
Because Fulaxida needs more

38:55.560 --> 38:57.690
high-quality capital like Xinzouqi.

38:58.310 --> 39:01.030
Qiansheng Group is very optimistic
about Fulaxida's

39:01.030 --> 39:02.620
model and future plans,

39:02.790 --> 39:04.080
and we've previously reached

39:04.080 --> 39:05.600
an investment intention with them.

39:05.600 --> 39:07.120
However, this company

39:07.120 --> 39:10.080
has just completed its privatization
and delisted from the U.S. stock market,

39:10.080 --> 39:12.230
and the capital transition
has not yet been finalized.

39:12.230 --> 39:12.830
So

39:12.830 --> 39:14.830
I'm thinking of using Xinzouqi's resources

39:14.830 --> 39:16.960
to help Qiansheng through this phase.

39:18.740 --> 39:19.460
I see.

39:19.920 --> 39:22.350
So you want me, as Xinzouqi's advisor,

39:22.480 --> 39:24.310
to strike a deal with Qiansheng?

39:25.600 --> 39:26.130
Exactly.

39:26.310 --> 39:27.310
Does Mr. Zhang know?

39:27.310 --> 39:27.910
Of course.

39:28.400 --> 39:30.700
Now it all depends on your stance.

39:33.670 --> 39:34.470
Alright then.

39:34.830 --> 39:36.090
You agreed so quickly.

39:38.270 --> 39:40.150
Cheers to our cooperation.

39:40.350 --> 39:41.220
Clink.

39:45.200 --> 39:45.710
Mr. Li.

39:46.350 --> 39:48.040
I won't beat around the bush then.

39:48.040 --> 39:48.570
Alright.

39:49.670 --> 39:50.600
I came here today

39:50.670 --> 39:52.710
to recommend myself.

39:53.400 --> 39:56.350
I was wondering if I could get a position
at Zhizhong Investment

39:56.350 --> 39:58.400
or Fulaxida.

40:00.190 --> 40:01.280
What do you mean?

40:02.440 --> 40:04.040
You are leaving Shanlifang?

40:05.190 --> 40:06.010
Yes.

40:06.320 --> 40:07.830
I want to be like you—

40:08.560 --> 40:11.530
build something that truly belongs to me.

40:13.630 --> 40:14.490
I'm impressed.

40:16.270 --> 40:18.080
But why does it have to be
Zhizhong Investment

40:18.080 --> 40:19.660
or Fulaxida?

40:19.970 --> 40:21.770
With your abilities, Miss Liao,

40:21.880 --> 40:23.740
you could join any major company.

40:24.040 --> 40:24.910
First,

40:25.080 --> 40:27.610
I agree with
Zhizhong Investment's business principles,

40:27.610 --> 40:30.790
and I'm optimistic about
Fulaxida's project prospects.

40:30.790 --> 40:33.150
Second, and more importantly,

40:33.920 --> 40:35.670
Mr. Li, I appreciate your working attitude

40:35.670 --> 40:36.870
and your competence.

40:38.520 --> 40:40.560
And I also believe our shared outlook
on studying abroad

40:40.560 --> 40:42.220
will lead to greater synergy.

40:42.700 --> 40:43.720
Therefore,

40:44.630 --> 40:47.050
I hope to work for a reliable company

40:47.120 --> 40:48.890
alongside reliable people.

40:50.400 --> 40:53.350
Regardless of the position or salary,

40:53.450 --> 40:54.470
I can accept it.

40:56.830 --> 40:57.590
Miss Liao.

40:59.880 --> 41:01.630
I completely understand

41:01.630 --> 41:04.270
the troubles brought by
your family background.

41:04.270 --> 41:07.350
And I'm very grateful for
your recognition of Zhizhong,

41:07.350 --> 41:08.520
Fulaxida,

41:08.670 --> 41:11.240
and myself.

41:11.520 --> 41:13.120
But Zhizhong has very strict requirements

41:13.120 --> 41:14.310
for professional alignment of employees

41:14.310 --> 41:15.600
these days.

41:17.120 --> 41:19.920
I remember you studied management
abroad, right?

41:19.920 --> 41:20.400
Yes.

41:21.190 --> 41:23.280
It might really not be a good fit.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.720
But Fulaxida could work.

41:26.730 --> 41:28.560
You could invest in the company
in your personal capacity

41:28.560 --> 41:29.710
and become a shareholder.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.710
What do you think?

41:30.790 --> 41:31.560
Invest?

41:33.230 --> 41:35.230
But I don't have much savings.

41:35.750 --> 41:38.100
For your needs,

41:38.440 --> 41:40.440
it might just be a drop in the bucket.

41:41.270 --> 41:41.920
I see.

41:42.400 --> 41:44.660
Well, that makes things a bit difficult.

41:44.880 --> 41:48.230
You see, there are no vacant positions
right now.

41:48.480 --> 41:51.150
If I were to create a position for you
out of thin air,

41:51.150 --> 41:53.680
wouldn't that end up
affecting you even more?

41:57.000 --> 41:58.440
That's a very tactful rejection, Mr. Li.

41:58.440 --> 42:00.120
No, no, no. That's not what I meant.

42:00.120 --> 42:01.480
What I actually want to say is,

42:01.480 --> 42:03.080
Miss Liao, with your abilities,

42:03.080 --> 42:04.520
you can totally develop

42:04.520 --> 42:05.810
a field of your own.

42:06.080 --> 42:07.610
Like resource allocation,

42:07.920 --> 42:09.310
or project management.

42:11.120 --> 42:11.980
How about this?

42:13.150 --> 42:14.350
I can recommend someone to you.

42:14.350 --> 42:14.920
Who?

42:15.480 --> 42:16.120
Gui Lili.

42:17.600 --> 42:18.480
Gui Lili?

42:21.000 --> 42:22.670
Isn't she the assistant to
Shanlifang's supplier,

42:22.670 --> 42:23.750
Mr. Niu?

42:24.670 --> 42:26.810
She's not just Mr. Niu's assistant.

42:26.880 --> 42:28.520
She is now his wife.

42:29.350 --> 42:31.880
She spends her days
sitting on a pile of money.

42:32.670 --> 42:34.350
She's always wanted to start a business,

42:34.350 --> 42:36.710
but she doesn't really have
a clear direction.

42:36.710 --> 42:37.560
So I think

42:37.830 --> 42:38.830
with your ability

42:39.480 --> 42:41.140
and her financial resources,

42:42.040 --> 42:45.100
you two should be able to
spark something interesting.

42:45.480 --> 42:47.350
Since she's so rich now,

42:47.440 --> 42:48.790
why don't you bring her in

42:48.790 --> 42:50.450
to invest in Fulaxida, Mr. Li?

42:52.270 --> 42:53.820
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:55.630 --> 42:56.360
How is it?

42:56.420 --> 42:58.280
Take a look around here first.

43:00.490 --> 43:01.520
Then do you know

43:02.570 --> 43:04.460
why I brought you here today?

43:05.030 --> 43:07.400
This apartment was only lived in
for a year,

43:07.400 --> 43:09.250
so it's basically brand new.

43:09.370 --> 43:11.000
And it's a standard unit type.

43:11.000 --> 43:12.330
Properties like yours are in high demand

43:11.030 --> 43:13.770
[21st Century Real Estate]

43:12.360 --> 43:14.090
on the resale market right now.

43:14.100 --> 43:14.830
I'll trouble you then.

43:14.830 --> 43:16.560
-Don't sell it!
-It's nothing.

43:17.080 --> 43:17.460
You...

43:17.460 --> 43:19.450
Qian Fei, are you out of your mind?

43:19.470 --> 43:20.570
Wang Ruohai's mother needs
a kidney transplant—

43:20.570 --> 43:21.920
why are you helping him
sell his apartment?
